OL,11,G0350FWitness History
OL,12,     GOn 26 January 1926, John Logie
OL,13,     GBaird demonstrated his
OL,14,     G'televisor' in public. It was the
OL,15,     Gprototype for television. His
OL,16,     Ggrandson, Iain Logie Baird, spoke
OL,17,     Gabout it in 2010.
